        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s1"
      },
      "text": "Dragonfly 2.0 Symantec has evidence indicating that the Dragonfly 2.0 campaign has been underway since at least December",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
